{"seq":2,"slug":"static-compilation-perf","title":"静态编译与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/groovy-jvm-scripting/practice/static-compilation-perf","wordCount":997,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"静态编译与性能\">静态编译与性能</h1><p>Groovy 的灵活有标价。每次 <code>obj.foo()</code> 都要查 MetaClass、走运行时分派，这层间接在热点循环里会累积成可观的开销。好消息是 Groovy 给了你一个开关：给类或方法加 <code>@CompileStatic</code>，编译器就把动态分派换成编译期绑定，性能逼近 Java——你按需为代码的不同部分选择「动态」还是「静态」。这一篇讲清这个权衡，以及背后的 invokedynamic 机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动态 Groovy 的方法调用要经过 MetaClass 查找，这是它慢于 Java 的根源。Groovy 有两条优化路线：invokedynamic（indy）让 JVM 的动态调用更快但仍是动态；<code>@CompileStatic</code> 则彻底绕过动态分派，生成与 Java 几乎一致的字节码。下图是三种模式的分派路径对比：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;obj.foo()&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;编译模式&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;默认动态&quot;| C[&quot;call site&lt;br/&gt;查 MetaClass&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;indy&quot;| D[&quot;invokedynamic&lt;br/&gt;JVM 缓存调用点&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;@CompileStatic&quot;| E[&quot;编译期绑定&lt;br/&gt;invokevirtual&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;最灵活&lt;br/&gt;最慢&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;仍动态&lt;br/&gt;较快&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;失去动态特性&lt;br/&gt;最快&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"obj.foo()\"] --&gt; B{\"编译模式\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"默认动态\"| C[\"call site&lt;br/&gt;查 MetaClass\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"indy\"| D[\"invokedynamic&lt;br/&gt;JVM 缓存调用点\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"@CompileStatic\"| E[\"编译期绑定&lt;br/&gt;invokevirtual\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"最灵活&lt;br/&gt;最慢\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"仍动态&lt;br/&gt;较快\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"失去动态特性&lt;br/&gt;最快\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>分派</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>保留动态特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认动态</td>\n<td>运行时 MetaClass</td>\n<td>基线（最慢）</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>invokedynamic</td>\n<td>JVM 动态调用点</td>\n<td>较快</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@TypeChecked</code></td>\n<td>运行时（仅加类型检查）</td>\n<td>同动态</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@CompileStatic</code></td>\n<td>编译期绑定</td>\n<td>接近 Java</td>\n<td>失去</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"typechecked-先要安全\">@TypeChecked：先要安全</h2><p><code>@TypeChecked</code> 不改变分派方式（仍是动态），但在编译期做静态类型检查，把拼错方法名、类型不匹配这类错误从运行期提前到编译期：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"groovy\" data-code=\"import groovy.transform.TypeChecked&#10;&#10;@TypeChecked&#10;class Order {&#10;  BigDecimal total(List&lt;BigDecimal&gt; items) {&#10;    items.sum() as BigDecimal   // 类型不符会编译报错&#10;  }&#10;  // def bad() { &quot;x&quot;.nonExistent() }  // 编译期即报：方法不存在&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import groovy.transform.TypeChecked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@TypeChecked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Order {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  BigDecimal total(List&#x3C;BigDecimal> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items.sum() as BigDecimal   // 类型不符会编译报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // def bad() { \"x\".nonExistent() }  // 编译期即报：方法不存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它是「不牺牲运行期灵活性、只买编译期安全」的折中。注意：被检查的代码里不能用 MOP 动态特性（如调用运行期合成的方法），否则编译器找不到方法声明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"compilestatic-换性能\">@CompileStatic：换性能</h2><p><code>@CompileStatic</code> 在 <code>@TypeChecked</code> 的基础上更进一步，把方法调用编译成静态绑定的字节码，运行期不再查 MetaClass。它本身就是一个 <a href=\"../metaprogramming/ast-transformations\">AST 转换</a>，在编译管线的规范化阶段重写方法体：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"groovy\" data-code=\"import groovy.transform.CompileStatic&#10;&#10;@CompileStatic&#10;class Matrix {&#10;  static double[][] multiply(double[][] a, double[][] b) {&#10;    int n = a.length, m = b[0].length, k = b.length&#10;    def r = new double[n][m]&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++)&#10;      for (int j = 0; j &lt; m; j++)&#10;        for (int p = 0; p &lt; k; p++)&#10;          r[i][j] += a[i][p] * b[p][j]&#10;    r&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import groovy.transform.CompileStatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@CompileStatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Matrix {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static double[][] multiply(double[][] a, double[][] b) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int n = a.length, m = b[0].length, k = b.length</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    def r = new double[n][m]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; n; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      for (int j = 0; j &#x3C; m; j++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int p = 0; p &#x3C; k; p++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          r[i][j] += a[i][p] * b[p][j]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段矩阵乘法在静态编译下的吞吐量与等价 Java 代码处于同一量级，而默认动态模式因为每次 <code>+=</code>、数组访问都走分派，会慢出数倍。性能差距随调用密度放大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该静态-何时该动态\">何时该静态、何时该动态</h2><p>静态编译不是越多越好——它会关掉 Groovy 的招牌动态能力。决策要看代码的角色：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代码类型</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热点数值循环</td>\n<td><code>@CompileStatic</code></td>\n<td>性能关键、不需动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库的公共 API</td>\n<td><code>@CompileStatic</code></td>\n<td>类型安全 + 性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSL 实现</td>\n<td>默认动态</td>\n<td>依赖 delegate/methodMissing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性脚本</td>\n<td>默认动态</td>\n<td>灵活优先、性能无所谓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用了 EMC/Category</td>\n<td>默认动态</td>\n<td>静态编译看不到运行期增强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条实用法则：默认写动态享受灵活，用基准测出热点后再对热点类加 <code>@CompileStatic</code>。DSL 代码（见 <a href=\"../metaprogramming/dsl-building\">构建领域特定语言</a>）和依赖 <a href=\"../metaprogramming/runtime-metaprogramming\">MOP 运行期增强</a> 的代码不能静态编译。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能模型\">性能模型</h2><p>把动态调用的相对开销写成简化模型有助直觉。设单次动态分派耗时是静态调用的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 通常在数倍量级），一段做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次调用的循环，动态版总耗时约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{dyn} \\approx N \\cdot k \\cdot t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，静态版约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{static} \\approx N \\cdot t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一次静态调用的基准耗时。加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = T_{dyn} / T_{static} \\approx k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与调用次数无关，但绝对节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(k-1)t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长——这解释了为什么只有高频热点值得静态化。Groovy 5 默认启用 invokedynamic，把动态路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 拉低了不少，使「默认动态」在很多场景已足够。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Groovy 默认走运行时 MetaClass 分派，是它慢于 Java 的根源；优化有 indy 与静态编译两路。</li>\n<li><code>@TypeChecked</code> 只加编译期类型检查、不改分派，是「只买安全不牺牲灵活」的折中。</li>\n<li><code>@CompileStatic</code> 是一个 <a href=\"../metaprogramming/ast-transformations\">AST 转换</a>，把调用编译成静态绑定，性能逼近 Java，代价是失去动态特性。</li>\n<li>决策按代码角色：热点循环与公共 API 静态化，DSL 与依赖 MOP 增强的代码保持动态。</li>\n<li>加速比约等于动态/静态分派倍率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，与调用数无关；Groovy 5 默认 indy 已拉低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"静态编译与性能","id":"静态编译与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"@TypeChecked：先要安全","id":"typechecked-先要安全"},{"level":2,"text":"@CompileStatic：换性能","id":"compilestatic-换性能"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该静态、何时该动态","id":"何时该静态-何时该动态"},{"level":2,"text":"性能模型","id":"性能模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"脚本化与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/groovy-jvm-scripting/practice/scripting-automation"},"next":{"title":"现代 JVM 上的 Groovy 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/groovy-jvm-scripting/practice/groovy-modern-jvm"}}